# Frontend Architecture

## Stack
Next.js 14 App Router, React Server Components by default. Client components only for charts, gauges, and any hover/click state. Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui primitives, lucide-react icons (stroke-width 1.6).

## App Router structure
```
apps/web/src/app/
├── (auth)/
│   └── login/page.tsx
└── (app)/
    ├── layout.tsx              # AppShell
    ├── overview/page.tsx
    ├── sources/
    │   ├── page.tsx
    │   └── new/[engine]/page.tsx   # wizard (resumable via URL)
    ├── datasets/
    │   ├── page.tsx
    │   └── [id]/page.tsx
    └── incidents/
        ├── page.tsx
        └── [id]/page.tsx
```

## RSC vs client components
- **Server** (default): page data fetching, static layout, tables, text content.
- **Client** (`"use client"`): charts, gauges, hover/click state, forms, theme toggle, Cmd-K.

Do not add `"use client"` unless actually needed. Minimise the client bundle.

## API client
Typed OpenAPI client generated from the server's `/openapi.json`. Types at `apps/web/src/generated/api.ts` (git-ignored). Frontend **never imports manually-written API types** — only generated ones.

React Query (TanStack Query) wraps all data fetching:
```typescript
const { data: incidents } = useQuery({
  queryKey: ['incidents', filters],
  queryFn: () => api.incidents.list(filters),
});
```

## State management
| Concern | Tool |
|---|---|
| Server data | React Query |
| Theme | zustand, persisted to localStorage |
| Cmd-K open | component-local |
| Wizard progress | URL search params (resumable) |
| Selected column/metric/DAG node | URL search params (`?col=order_total`) |

## Fonts
`next/font/google`:
- Inter Tight — UI, body, headings (weights 200–600, `ss01 cv11`)
- JetBrains Mono — code, identifiers, numeric KPIs, stat values (weights 300–500, `calt 0`)

## shadcn/ui usage
Install components to `apps/web/src/components/ui/`. Override `Card` radius to 0. Use `accent` variant on `Button`. Use `pass`/`warn`/`fail` variants on `Badge`. Use Sonner for toasts.

## Custom components
Live in `apps/web/src/components/`:
- `charts/` — `StatGauge`, `StatChip`, `Spark`, `TimeSeries`, `HistDual`, `CDFPair`, `KLMatrix`, `CausalDAG`
- `shared/` — `AppShell`, `InfoTip`, `StatusDot`, `EngineGlyph`

## Build gate
After writing any frontend code, run `pnpm build` and fix all errors and warnings before reporting done.

## i18n
All user-facing strings via `next-intl`. See `i18n.mdc`.
